d> </tr> <tr> <td>CTF-Alpha-9</td> <td>Curious Cats</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4473">SCP-4473</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Alpha-10</td> <td>Extraordinary Evidence</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4519">SCP-4519</a></td> <td>A combat force assembled to carry out counteroffensive measures against <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/non-prophet-organization-hub">SAPPHIRE</a>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-10</td> <td>[DATA MISSING]</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4711">SCP-4711</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Alpha-12</td> <td>Flatheads</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1650">SCP-1650</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Alpha-13</td> <td>Meat Packers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2445">SCP-2445</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-13</td> <td>Odor Eaters</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4032">SCP-4032</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• STF-Alpha-15</td> <td>Catch &amp; Release</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4664">SCP-4664</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-16</td> <td>Uncle Mike's</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/internal-memo-regarding-a-theft">Interlude: An Internal Memo Regarding a Theft</a></td> <td>No description given.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Alpha-17</td> <td>God’s Pallbearers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2612">SCP-2612</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-Alpha-19</td> <td>Romeo and Juliets</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2776">SCP-2776</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-19</td> <td>Alt-Fight</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3210">SCP-3210</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Alpha-20</td> <td>Holy Divers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1730">S