ns</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3787">SCP-3787</a></td> <td>A task force specializing in quick insertions into hostile territory.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>PTF-Chi / PTF-ち</td> <td>Manhunter</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP-4886</a></td> <td>A Provisional Task Force assigned to monitoring Agent Lancelot's movements. Is presumably lost within <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP-4886</a>.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-刀-五</td> <td>Karma</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4161">SCP-4161</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>ATF-Detroit-11</td> <td>Blessed Rain</td> <td><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/djkaktus-s-proposal-ii">SCP-001 - CODE NAME: djkaktus - Atonement</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-DE6-𝔇</td> <td>Das Aufgebot (The Squad)</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-125-de">SCP-125-DE</a></td> <td>Respond to unknown anomalies and destroy, contain or overwhelm them.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-DE15-𝔑</td> <td>Nemo's Crew</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-005-int">SCP-005-INT</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• OTF ढ-3</td> <td>The Ides</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2813">SCP-2813</a></td> <td>Orbital Task Force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• PTF-Duplic-4</td> <td>Inner Workings</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4029">SCP-4029</a></td> <td>A small group of personnel assembled to explore the interior of SCP-4029. Mostly made it out alive.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• MTF-ε</td> <td>Tyrfing Black</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4910">SCP-4910</a></td> <td>No description given.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Echo-5</td> <td>Sting Operation</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4169">SCP-4169</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>LTF Echo-5</td> <td>Ski Jumpers</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5177">SCP-5177</a></td> <td>Handles retrieval of lost Foundation agents from anomalous territory.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Edna-84</td> <td>And Thus Upon His Crucible</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4335">SCP-4335</a></td> <td>An MTF Squad dedicated to the research and containment of very dangerous anomalies located with modern video games.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Ehwaz-1</td> <td>[<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4857">REDACTED</a>]</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4857">SCP-4857</a></td> <td>[<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4857">REDACTED</a>]</td> </tr> <tr> <td>• OTF-ग-3</td> <td>Cochrane's Children</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/first55">The First Fifty-Five</a></td> <td>Orbital Task Force (<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/sotmhub">Straight On Till Morning</a>.)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>TF-He-2 / TF ה2</td> <td>Yogi's Nightmare</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP-4886</a></td> <td>Assigned to the termination of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP-4886</a>-A and enforcing anti-trespassing measures for SCP-4886's exclusion zone.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>SSM-II</td> <td>Legio Atlantidis</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-019-it">SCP-019-IT</a></td> <td>An Italian task force suitable for missions at sea or in any case related to aquatic environments.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>SSM-IV</td> <td>Pugnus Ferri</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-019-it">SCP-019-IT</a></td> <td>An Italian task force, involved in the containment of elusive and/or aggressive anomalies and in clashes with hostile GoIs.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>ATF-Indianapolis-13</td> <td>Killboys</td> <td><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/djkaktus-s-proposal-ii">SCP-001 - CODE NAME: djkaktus - Atonement</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>PTF-Ji / PTF-ぢ</td> <td>Red Dragon</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP-4886</a></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4886">SCP</a>-specific Provisional Task Force. PTF-ぢ consists of asexual/celibate personnel with experience in forensics, trackin