&lt;p&gt;Site-01 internal database automated search protocol initiated. Please enter a command.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt;access scp-0000-ex&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It appears that you are accessing a file that is Level 5 Classified. Please input your credentials. Failure to comply with the login protocol at any point will result in termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;login: O5-12&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remember: Impersonating a member of the Overwatch Council is punishable by termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;password: the past does hold our many sins&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does the future dream?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Only when we let it.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
