&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[FAILURE TO COMPLY WILL RESULT IN &lt;em&gt;75432156789VSFYG@@#!^*)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
