<a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607005469" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span> - (&quot;Team of the Oinks&quot;) Commander: The Pighead<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6391595&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607005469" alt="Quadraginta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6391595)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quadraginta" >Quadraginta</a></span> - (&quot;Typing Type’a Typos Team&quot;) Commander: Truc Linh<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607005469" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607005469" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span> - (&quot;Flight of the Bumblecrits&quot;) Commander: weizhong</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>October 2020 Flight Officers:</strong></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar