&lt;p&gt;Dear ███████,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s me, Kenoma! I would love to answer your questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was never a good writer, to be honest. Still, I do enjoy writing sometimes, especially during the most boring times. I mostly read Wikipedia articles, religious texts and the works of H.P. Lovecraft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I wrote my first SCP in 2017, but due to an incident, I &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;had to&lt;/span&gt; deleted four of my first SCPs that I&#039;ve written within one or two months. It was really sad. I resumed writing a few months later and managed to co-write an article with Zyn, but after that, I stopped because of school.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It was only recently that I started writing again. Here are my current SCPs:&lt;/p&gt;

